  "notes": "### Fixed\n\n- The Windows EXE installer now honors \"Do not uninstall\" when an existing MSI installation is detected. It closes setup without launching the uninstaller. The page explains that updating an MSI installation in place requires the MSI installer, and no longer mislabels MSI's encoded version as a newer app version.\n\n### First-run warnings\n\nThese builds are unsigned. Your OS may complain on first launch:\n\n- **macOS** (Gatekeeper): the first-launch dialog on macOS 15+ only offers \"Move to Trash\" or \"Done\" \u2014 click **Done**, then either:\n    - **Terminal:** `xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine \"/Applications/ATV Optimizer.app\"` (one-time, then double-click as normal)\n    - **GUI:** System Settings \u2192 Privacy & Security \u2192 scroll to the \"ATV Optimizer was blocked\" message \u2192 **Open Anyway** \u2192 enter password\n- **Windows** (SmartScreen): \"More info\" \u2192 \"Run anyway\".\n- **Linux**: `chmod +x ATV.Optimizer*.AppImage` before running.\n\nSee the [v2 README](https://github.com/LosLonelyDevs/shield_optimizer/blob/main/v2/README.md) for setup and feature docs.",
